s.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780070972131","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780070972131","name":"2. Which day gets the most engagement on LinkedIn in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Wednesday usually gets the highest LinkedIn engagement in India, followed by Tuesday and Thursday. Midweek posting works best because professionals are more active and likely to engage with industry insights and business-related content.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780070989745","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780070989745","name":"3. Is LinkedIn better in the morning or evening in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Morning\u00a0LinkedIn posting times\u00a0between 9 AM and 12 PM IST usually perform better in India. Evening slots between 5 PM and 7 PM IST can still work well for personal branding and thought leadership content.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071008210","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071008210","name":"4. What is the\u00a0best time to post on LinkedIn\u00a0today?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The\u00a0best time to post on LinkedIn\u00a0today depends on the day of the week. Tuesday to Thursday perform best between 10 AM and 12 PM IST, while Friday usually performs better around late morning.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071023814","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071023814","name":"5. What is the best time for B2B LinkedIn marketing in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For B2B marketing, the\u00a0best time to post on LinkedIn\u00a0in India is Tuesday and Wednesday between 10 AM and 12 PM IST. These slots usually attract decision-makers, recruiters, founders, and working professionals.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071040587","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071040587","name":"6. When are recruiters most active on LinkedIn India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Recruiters in India are most active on LinkedIn between 10 AM and 2 PM IST from Tuesday to Thursday. This window usually brings better visibility, stronger networking opportunities, and higher response rates for job seekers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071055535","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071055535","name":"7. Should I post on LinkedIn on weekends in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The\u00a0best time to post on LinkedIn in India on weekends\u00a0is Sunday between 8 AM and 9 AM IST. Weekend engagement is usually lower, so weekdays\u00a0remain\u00a0more effective for professional and B2B content.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-time-to-post-on-linkedin\/#faq-question-1780071070484","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blo